route-thread-writer-coordination-to-harness

Lane: normalization

Unit: route-thread-writer-locks-to-harness

ChildPatch: route-thread-writer-coordination-to-harness

Form: GitDiff

Segment: none

Purpose: Coordinate all thread writers and rollout compression under the selected harness while retaining durable thread data in home.

Requires: Unit:normalization/normalize-base-roots-for-processes

Provides: Carry the harness through rollout and thread-store configuration, app-server goals and TUI consumers; place writer locks, compression locks, and maintenance throttling state there with shared live-writer exclusion and isolated test fixtures.

Boundary: Thread contents, database placement, compression format, and archive semantics retain their existing owners; process-root and isolated harness-fixture construction remain normalize-base-roots-for-processes responsibilities.

Verification: Rollout writer_lock and compression_tests, thread-store compression_writer_tests, guardian_goal_tests and idle-unload shutdown tests verify harness-only coordination, separate roots, active-writer exclusion, goal updates and delayed thread closure.


